{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13657","headline":"奉和皇甫大夫祈雨应时雨降 · 严维","name":"奉和皇甫大夫祈雨应时雨降","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"致和知必感，岁旱未书灾。\n伯禹明灵降，元戎祷请来。\n九成陈夏乐，三献奉殷罍。\n掣曳旗交电，铿锵鼓应雷。\n行云依盖转，飞雨逐车回。\n欲识皇天意，爲霖贶在哉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"严维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13657.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13657","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}